Package: DynMSR
Title: Toolkit for Working with DynMS Models in R
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(given = "Evgeny", family = "Metelkin", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "evgeny.metelkin@gmail.com")
  )
Description: Provides tools to read and validate models stored in the DynMS
    format, and to generate and build an 'mrgsolve' backend. Heta projects and
    SBML files can be loaded through a compatible optional 'heta-compiler'
    installation. DynMSR is intended as an interoperability toolkit between
    DynMS and R modeling backends.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1)
Imports:
    jsonlite,
    jsonvalidate,
    whisker
Suggests:
    mrgsolve,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    withr
Config/testthat/edition: 3
URL: https://github.com/hetalang/DynMSR
BugReports: https://github.com/hetalang/DynMSR/issues
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.0.0
